{"id":"cirugi_a","lemma":"cirugía","pos":"noun","rank":1443,"glosses":["surgery"],"ipa":"/θiɾuˈxia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cirugías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cirug%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"La cirugía duró tres horas.","en":"The surgery lasted three hours.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1086629"},{"text":"Tom tuvo cirugía el lunes pasado.","en":"Tom had surgery last Monday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352403"},{"text":"La cirugía es la mejor solución.","en":"Surgery is the best solution.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/730245"},{"text":"Tom no necesitó más cirugía.","en":"Tom didn't need more surgery."},{"text":"Tom va a tener cirugía.","en":"Tom is going to have surgery."}]}